# ---- 虚拟环境 / 依赖 ----
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
**/site-packages/

# ---- 运行产物（体积大、可再生产）----
**/captures/
**/reports/
**/uploads/
**/tests/.out/
**/.ekko-tmp/
.ekko-tmp*

# ---- 凭据（绝不入库）----
**/cookies/
*.cookie
.env
*.pem
*.key

# ---- 其它 ----
*.log
*.bgr
*.tmp
.DS_Store

# ---- 报告快照备份（含第三方样本，绝不入库）----
**/reports.bak/
**/reports*/
